                                                           <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "longitude" .


###  https://w3id.org/semanticarts/ns/ontology/gist/numericValue
<https://w3id.org/semanticarts/ns/ontology/gist/numericValue> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
